  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are the master of morphic mindscapes.<br>\n<strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Alter Binary Mindscape<sup>OA</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your enemy must spend 2 additional manifestation points each time he uses a defensive manifestation and 1 additional manifestation point whenever he uses any other manifestation. This extra manifestation point is wasted and does not provide any other benefit, like increasing the number of damage dice dealt by an offensive manifestation.</p>\n<p>In addition, when your opponent’s offensive manifestation would cause you to become blinded, confused, dazed, entangled, nauseated, or shaken, as an immediate action you can expend manifestation points equal to the number of manifestation points equal to the cost of that offensive manifestation to negate its effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
